✅ Definition of Done (Universal)
Every task is complete ONLY when:

🎯 Product Perspective Documented

 User need articulated

 Success metric defined

 Priority justified

🏗️ Architecture Perspective Documented

 Design approach chosen (with alternatives considered)

 Scalability assessed

 Risks identified

🎨 Design Perspective Documented (if user-facing)

 User flow diagrammed

 Accessibility checklist completed

 Design reviewed

💻 Engineering Perspective Documented

 Code written, reviewed, clean

 Follows conventions

 Performance acceptable

 Error handling implemented

🧪 QA Perspective Documented

 Tests written and passing (>80% coverage)

 Edge cases tested

 Platform matrix validated

🔒 Security Perspective Documented

 Threat model reviewed

 Security checklist completed

 No critical vulnerabilities

🚀 Operations Perspective Documented

 Deployment plan confirmed

 Monitoring/alerting in place

 Rollback tested

📝 Brain Updated

 All perspective docs updated

 Timeline entry added

 Cross-references added

 INDEX.md updated

✅ Commit Made

 Descriptive message (references brain docs)

 Code + brain changes in same commit

