🔄 Mandatory Reflection Questions
After completing each perspective, Cursor must answer:

"What did I almost miss?"
(Forces catching blind spots)

"What assumption am I making?"
(Surfaces hidden dependencies)

"What would a skeptic ask me about this?"
(Stress-tests reasoning)

"If this fails in production, what would be the most likely cause?"
(Forward-looking risk assessment)

These answers go in the respective perspective doc under "Reflection Notes."

